## 🧿 18. ADMIN & OPERATIONS PANEL

A comprehensive "God Mode" for the ops team.
Features required:
- Vendor KYC auto-rejection overrides.
- Viewing Chat Logs to arbitrate disputes.
- Changing platform global commission rates dynamically.

