## 📊 19. ANALYTICS & TELEMETRY

- **Application Logs:** Winston/Pino pushing to Datadog.
- **Error Tracking:** Sentry initialized in every Node/Next/Flutter runtime.
- **Business Events:** Pushing event data to Mixpanel (e.g., `User_Viewed_Venue`, `Quotation_Rejected`).

