| Competitor | Classification | Their Weakness | Our Weapon |
|---|---|---|---|
| **WedMeGood** | Discovery Directory | No post-booking tooling. Monetizes clicks. | Complete Execution UI. We monetize transactions. |
| **WeddingWire** | Global Directory | Very westernized flow. Poor local vendor integration. | Deep localized AI budget logic and Escrow security. |
| **JustDial** | Classifieds | Massive spam. Fraud listings. | 100% KYC verified vendors. |

